
### Diagram Files

#### 1. `diagrams/architecture.puml`
```plantuml
@startuml
!theme azure
left to right direction

component "API Gateway" as gateway
component "Azure Functions" as func
database "Cosmos DB (Hot)" as cosmos
cloud "Blob Storage (Cold)" as blob
component "CDN" as cdn
component "Application Insights" as ai
component "Azure Monitor" as monitor

gateway --> func : HTTP Requests
func --> cosmos : Read/Write
func --> blob : Archive/Retrieve
blob --> cdn : Caching
cosmos --> func : Change Feed
func --> ai : Telemetry
ai --> monitor : Alerts
monitor --> func : Auto-scale

